HBL vs Askari Bank (AKBL) – Fundamental Analysis Dashboard

Overview

This project presents a comparative fundamental analysis of HBL (Habib Bank Limited) and Askari Bank (AKBL). The objective is to evaluate both banks using key financial metrics, profitability indicators, valuation ratios, and growth trends.

Features

- Market Capitalization Comparison
- Profit Growth Analysis
- ROE (Return on Equity) Comparison
- Dividend Analysis
- Financial Ratio Comparison
- Strengths and Risk Assessment
- Fundamental Quality Evaluation
- Visual Dashboard Representation

Metrics Covered

- Market Cap
- Net Profit Growth
- P/E Ratio
- P/B Ratio
- ROE
- Dividend Performance
- Fundamental Strengths
- Watch Points

Key Insights

HBL

- Strong market leadership
- Large deposit base
- Consistent profitability
- Diversified banking operations

Askari Bank (AKBL)

- Strong growth potential
- Healthy profitability
- Improving dividend profile
- Efficient cost management

